# The Gaia S1 R18 evidence fixture is hashed byte for byte, so every
# end-of-line conversion must be disabled in both directions: a single CRLF/LF
# rewrite on checkout invalidates every declared SHA-256 in the manifest.
#
# This file lives one level ABOVE the fixture directory on purpose. The census
# reports any file inside the evidence root that the manifest does not declare,
# and the manifest declares exactly thirteen files plus itself; a .gitattributes
# inside the fixture would be a fifteenth entry and would make the unlisted-file
# count non-zero on the happy path.
gaia-s1-r18/** -text
